OL,3,GNEWSAFire service fighting wild fire
OL,4,A'on two fronts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service has confirmed that it is
OL,7,Fbattling a "large field fire" on the
OL,8,Foutskirts of a town.
OL,10,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService said that it had six fire
OL,12,Fappliances tackling the five-hectare
OL,13,Fblaze in Norton Fitzwarren, near
OL,14,FTaunton, "on two fronts" as it had
OL,15,Fspread over fields and into woodland.
OL,17,FA drone was also called in to monitor
OL,18,Fthe fire as crews used hose reel jets,
OL,19,Ffire beaters and water backpacks to
OL,20,Ffight the fire.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
